  "articleBody": "It's super frustrating when your luxury home's floor plans don't quite match up to reality, right? You'd think they'd be spot-on, especially for a high-value property, but often they're not intended for precision beyond marketing. Many plans are quick scans meant to show layout, not to be a blueprint for construction or appraisal, which can lead to big discrepancies. Understanding this difference is key to avoiding issues down the line.",
  "datePublished": "2026-10-01"
}